  <name>JW Library on Linux</name>
  <summary>Read .jwpub publications offline</summary>
  <summary xml:lang="pt-BR">Leia publicações .jwpub sem internet</summary>
  <developer id="io.github.cruzthiago2010"><name>Thiago Monteiro Cruz</name></developer>
  <description>
    <p>A community-made reader for .jwpub publication files, in the style of JW Library for Windows. It works offline with the files you import. Not an official app and not affiliated with the publishers.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Library by category, Bible with study notes and search, meetings of the week</li>
      <li>Highlights in six colors, notes with tags and bookmarks</li>
      <li>Library like JW Library: every publication of the jw.org catalog, one-click download, new issues and updates</li>
      <li>Video and Audio tabs: watch and listen, download for offline use, audio Bible</li>
      <li>Backup in the same .jwlibrary format used on phones</li>
      <li>English and Brazilian Portuguese interface</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
  <launchable type="desktop-id">io.github.cruzthiago2010.JW-Library-on-Linux.desktop</launchable>
  <url type="homepage">https://github.com/cruzthiago2010/JW-Library-on-Linux</url>
